{
  "$comment": "qops hooks. Wired per ADR-0001, which measured every event below. Commands invoke `qops <verb>` and nothing else; every project specific lives in .qops/config.yml. Invoked as `python -m qops` because a bare `qops` resolves in neither cmd.exe nor git-bash without a PATH edit, and a PATH edit is a machine fact that does not belong in a committed file.",
  "permissions": {
    "$comment": "Sign-off item 10, 2026-08-16. The rule the owner gave: if a prompt class has never once been answered no, it is allowlisted. That is four classes and no more - waits, reads, test runs, and `gh api` GETs. Everything here is machine-independent; absolute-path variants are a machine fact and live in settings.local.json. DELIBERATELY NOT ALLOWLISTED, and this is a taken decision rather than an omission: `gh api` with a write method. `gh api` bare is a GET, so the allow rule below is safe only because the deny rules take the method flags back - a write to repo settings, branch protection or a label set is the owner's call every time, and ADR-0016/0020 rest on those settings being what the owner last set them to.",
    "allow": [
      "Bash(sleep:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr diff:*)",
      "Bash(gh run watch:*)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh label list:*)",
      "Bash(gh api:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse:*)",
      "Bash(git check-ignore:*)",
      "Bash(git worktree list:*)",
      "Bash(python -m pytest:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m pytest:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops brief:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops ledger:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops resume:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops doctor:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops metrics:*)",
      "Bash(python -m qops pending:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops brief:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops ledger:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops resume:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops doctor:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops metrics:*)",
      "Bash({{python}} -m qops pending:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(gh api -X:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --method:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -f:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --field:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -F:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --input:*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops brief" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops ledger session_start" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops guard" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops ledger stop" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops resume --write --quiet" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops resume --write --quiet" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "python -m qops ledger session_end" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
